==English==

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|pos=[[at]] [[once]]|-}}

# {{idiom}} [[at the same time|At the same time]]; [[simultaneously]]; [[together]].
#: ''Can you pat your head and rub your belly '''at once'''?''
# {{idiom}} [[immediately|Immediately]]; [[now]]; [[right away]].
#: ''Tell the doctor to come '''at once'''. She is having a baby.''

